//
// Go agent executor — receives crew/agent invocations from the Python
// LangGraph orchestrator and runs them. Stateless function-of-input design.
// Cloud Run scale-to-zero per agent (one Cloud Run service per executor agent).
//
// Per BLANKET migration (Tier 2 D5): all 24 runtime AI agents migrate to this
// hybrid pattern at M14 — Python orchestrator drives the StateGraph, Go
// executor runs each node's actual work (model calls, tool calls, validators).
//
// **6-AGENT CONTENT GATE** (per Phyllis MVP §5.7 + audit-aikernel §3 + ADR
// content gate model):
//   1. validator         — input sanity + LearningAtom contract validation
//   2. classifier        — topic / difficulty / locale labelling
//   3. web_researcher    — fact-grounding via web search adapter
//   4. q_and_a_generator — MCQ / short-answer body generation
//   5. evaluator         — quality + correctness scoring
//   6. reporter          — Three-Audience explainability stamps + IMDA D2 evidence
//
// Each gate agent is a SEPARATE Cloud Run service (one per agent_role) using
// THIS gRPC contract. The orchestrator (Python LangGraph) calls each agent
// in sequence as graph nodes. ExecuteAgentRequest.agent_role is the
// dispatch dimension (e.g., "creation-validator", "creation-classifier",
// "creation-web-researcher", "creation-q-and-a-generator",
// "creation-evaluator", "creation-reporter").
//
// Executor handles:
//   - tool calls (browser, search, RAG retrieval, domain-service reads)
//   - gRPC out to Model Broker Router → Gateway for LLM invocations
//   - gRPC out to Guardrail Service for runtime evaluation
//   - OTLP span emission with OpenInference attributes
//   - idempotent retry-safe handlers (orchestrator may retry on pod loss)
//
// Two RPC shapes:
//   - ExecuteAgent: synchronous unary (single agent step)
//   - StreamAgentExecution: server-stream of ExecutionEvents for long-running
//     agents (browser interactions, multi-tool reasoning)
//
// mTLS via the service mesh; SPIFFE identity in mesh; W3C trace context in
// gRPC metadata propagated from the orchestrator.
// =============================================================================

